 | 5 | Phase 1 | `p1_005_identity_sections` | `sections` | `.lattice/graph.db` | `lattice-core::identity` |
 | 6 | Phase 1 | `p1_006_identity_tests` | `tests` | `.lattice/graph.db` | `lattice-core::identity` |
